// M7 (MINE) == THE SELF-CHECK IS DECORATION.  iv_check is the only thing that
// turns a corrupt arena into a loud refusal; every one of C502..C509 got worse
// precisely because nothing was checking.  This mutant removes the checker and
// changes NOTHING ELSE: every write, every count and every answer stays exactly
// as the fixed engine produces it.  A battery that still passes here has no
// evidence that the fixed engine's refusals come from a validator rather than
// from luck.
fn iv_check(W:[]u8)i32 {
  if(iv_ok(W)==0){return 1;}
  return 0;
}
